{"task_id": "Mbpp/7", "solution": "def find_char_long(input: str) -> set[str]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Extracts all unique words of at least four characters from the input string.\n\n    Parameters:\n        input (str): The string to process.\n\n    Returns:\n        set[str]: A set of unique words with length >= 4.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Split on any whitespace\n    words = input.split()\n    # Filter and deduplicate\n    return {word for word in words if len(word) >= 4}"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/6", "solution": "def differ_At_One_Bit_Pos(a: int, b: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Return True if integers a and b differ at exactly one bit position.\n    \"\"\"\n    xor = a ^ b\n    # Count set bits using Brian Kernighan's algorithm.\n    count = 0\n    while xor:\n        xor &= xor - 1\n        count += 1\n    return count == 1"}
