{"task_id": "Mbpp/12", "solution": "import collections\nfrom typing import List\ndef sort_matrix(matrix: List[List[int]]) -> List[List[int]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Sorts a matrix by the sum of its rows in ascending order, maintaining stability.\n    Returns a new matrix without modifying the input.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not matrix:\n        return []\n\n    # Pair each row with its sum and original index for stable sorting\n    rows_with_sums = []\n    for i, row in enumerate(matrix):\n        rows_with_sums.append((sum(row), i, row))\n\n    # Sort based on row sum (primary) and original index (secondary for stability)\n    rows_with_sums.sort()\n\n    # Extract the sorted rows into a new list\n    sorted_matrix = [item[2] for item in rows_with_sums]\n\n    return sorted_matrix"}
