{"task_id": "Mbpp/99", "solution": "def decimal_to_binary(decimal: int) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Converts a non-negative decimal integer to its binary string equivalent.\"\"\"\n    if decimal == 0:\n        return \"0\"\n    \n    bits = []\n    n = decimal\n    while n > 0:\n        bits.append(str(n % 2))\n        n //= 2\n        \n    return \"\".join(reversed(bits))"}
