{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "from typing import List\ndef zero_count(numbers: List[int]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the ratio of zeroes to non-zeroes in a list of integers.\"\"\"\n    zeroes = 0\n    non_zeroes = 0\n    for num in numbers:\n        if num == 0:\n            zeroes += 1\n        else:\n            non_zeroes += 1\n\n    if non_zeroes == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    else:\n        return float(zeroes) / non_zeroes"}
