{"task_id": "Mbpp/145", "solution": "from typing import Iterable, Union\nNumber = Union[int, float]\ndef max_Abs_Diff(sequence: Iterable[Number]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum difference between any two elements in a sequence.\n    Returns 0 if the sequence has fewer than two elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    iterator = iter(sequence)\n    try:\n        first_element = next(iterator)\n    except StopIteration:\n        return 0\n\n    min_val = first_element\n    max_val = first_element\n    count = 1\n\n    for item in iterator:\n        if item < min_val:\n            min_val = item\n        elif item > max_val:\n            max_val = item\n        count += 1\n\n    if count < 2:\n        return 0\n    return int(max_val - min_val)"}
