{"task_id": "Mbpp/166", "solution": "def find_even_pair(nums: list) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of unordered pairs of integers in a list\n    whose bitwise XOR operation results in an even number.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    n = len(nums)\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            # Two numbers XOR to an even number if and only if they have the same parity.\n            if (nums[i] % 2) == (nums[j] % 2):\n                count += 1\n    return count"}
