{"task_id": "Mbpp/172", "solution": "def count_occurance(s: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts non-overlapping occurrences of 'std' in the given string.\n    The matching is case-sensitive.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    i = 0\n    target = 'std'\n    target_len = len(target)\n    s_len = len(s)\n\n    while i <= s_len - target_len:\n        if s[i:i + target_len] == target:\n            count += 1\n            i += target_len  # Move past the found occurrence for non-overlapping\n        else:\n            i += 1\n    return count"}
