{"task_id": "Mbpp/283", "solution": "def validate(value: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the frequency of each digit in the integer is less than or equal to the digit itself,\n    and ensures the digit 0 does not appear.\n    \"\"\"\n    counts = [0] * 10\n    \n    if value == 0:\n        counts[0] = 1 # Special case for input 0\n    else:\n        temp_value = value\n        while temp_value > 0:\n            digit = temp_value % 10\n            counts[digit] += 1\n            temp_value //= 10\n\n    for digit_val in range(10):\n        frequency = counts[digit_val]\n        if digit_val == 0:\n            if frequency > 0:\n                return False  # Digit 0 cannot appear\n        else:\n            if frequency > digit_val:\n                return False  # Frequency exceeds digit value\n\n    return True"}
