{"task_id": "Mbpp/395", "solution": "from typing import Optional\ndef first_non_repeating_character(input: str) -> Optional[str]:\n    \"\"\"Finds the first non-repeated character in a given string.\n    Returns None if no non-repeating character is found.\"\"\"\n    if not input:\n        return None\n\n    # Count character frequencies\n    freq = {}\n    for ch in input:\n        freq[ch] = freq.get(ch, 0) + 1\n\n    # Find the first character with a frequency of 1\n    for ch in input:\n        if freq[ch] == 1:\n            return ch\n\n    return None"}
