{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the average of the cubes of the first n natural numbers using a closed-form formula.\n    Assumes n is a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Sum of cubes of first n natural numbers is (n*(n+1)/2)^2\n    sum_of_cubes = (n * (n + 1) / 2)**2\n    average = sum_of_cubes / n\n    return float(average)"}
