{"task_id": "Mbpp/479", "solution": "def first_Digit(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the first digit of a given non-negative number.\n    Raises ValueError for negative inputs according to design specification.\n    \"\"\"\n    if number < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input must be non-negative\")\n    if number == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    while number >= 10:\n        number //= 10\n    return number"}
