{"task_id": "Mbpp/566", "solution": "def sum_digits(number):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the digits of a non-negative integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    digit_sum = 0\n    # Handle the case of number 0 explicitly if the loop doesn't\n    # or ensure the loop correctly handles it. The while loop handles 0.\n    if number == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    temp_number = number\n    while temp_number > 0:\n        digit_sum += temp_number % 10\n        temp_number //= 10  # Use integer division\n    return digit_sum"}
