{"task_id": "Mbpp/598", "solution": "def armstrong_number(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if a number is an Armstrong number.\n    An Armstrong number is one whose sum of digits raised to the power of the number of digits equals the number itself.\n    \"\"\"\n    num_str = str(number)\n    num_digits = len(num_str)\n    armstrong_sum = 0\n    for digit_char in num_str:\n        armstrong_sum += int(digit_char) ** num_digits\n    return armstrong_sum == number"}
