{"task_id": "Mbpp/605", "solution": "import math\ndef prime_num(num):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if an integer is a prime number.\n    Returns True if prime, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if num <= 1:\n        return False\n    if num == 2:\n        return True\n    if num % 2 == 0:\n        return False\n\n    i = 3\n    while i * i <= num:\n        if num % i == 0:\n            return False\n        i += 2\n            \n    return True"}
