{"task_id": "Mbpp/638", "solution": "import math\ndef wind_chill(wind_velocity, temperature):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the wind chill index given wind velocity in km/h and temperature in celsius,\n    rounding the result up to the next integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    T = temperature\n    V = wind_velocity\n    \n    # Wind Chill Formula: 13.12 + 0.6215*T - 11.37*V^0.16 + 0.3965*T*V^0.16\n    wind_chill_raw = 13.12 + (0.6215 * T) - (11.37 * (V**0.16)) + (0.3965 * T * (V**0.16))\n    \n    # Round up to the next integer\n    return int(math.ceil(wind_chill_raw))"}
