{"task_id": "Mbpp/797", "solution": "def sum_in_range(l, r):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all odd natural numbers within the inclusive range [l, r].\n    Uses the arithmetic series formula for O(1) performance.\n    \"\"\"\n    if l > r:\n        return 0\n\n    # Determine the first odd number that is >= l\n    first_odd = l if l % 2 != 0 else l + 1\n\n    # Determine the last odd number that is <= r\n    last_odd = r if r % 2 != 0 else r - 1\n\n    # If the calculated first_odd is greater than last_odd, there are no odd numbers in the range.\n    if first_odd > last_odd:\n        return 0\n\n    # Calculate the count of odd numbers in the range\n    count = (last_odd - first_odd) // 2 + 1\n\n    # Calculate the sum using the arithmetic series formula: sum = n * (a_1 + a_n) / 2\n    total_sum = count * (first_odd + last_odd) // 2\n\n    return total_sum"}
